I have noticed that lots of people have been downloading the new kernel but 
not the updated procps nor net-tools.  You will need these extra rpms to make 
everything work properly.  If you want to use srm-console you will need the 
updated aboot.  If you are going to attempt to use some of the newer drivers 
you will probably want to install the updated kudzu.

We have not added yet added these as dependencies to the updated kernel rpms.

I hope this helps.

--George

