Dear Stephen & list:

There is an installation guide at 

http://www.support.compaq.com/alpha-tools/redhat/ig/index.html

There used to be machine-specific guides on the Compaq/DEC site as well,
but I can't seem to find them. 

If you look at the traffic on the Tru64 managers' list, a lot of it has
those silly confidentiality stickers at the bottom.  Usually they are
the doing of a company's legal department and the SysAdmin can't do much
about them.  It would be a shame if this list collectively decided not
to help out when someone wanted to run Linux on an Alpha machine ....
the tribe is a little thin on the ground as it is, and IMHO can not
afford to throw out members for minor infractions of the unwritten
rulkes.

jn

"Thursday"


